        <detaileddescription>
<para>Prevents the same message from being logged too frequently. The message is logged only if the specified interval has elapsed since the last log with the same key.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>message</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
