</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Minimum time between logs (default: 2.0).</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Uses a key to track the last time a message was logged. If the current time minus the last log time is less than the interval, the message is skipped.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
